WEBVTT

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:14.610
"Morocco"

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:45.140
Here is your room, Madam.

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:01.620
Nice view, isn't it?

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:03.660
The desert looks like a sea.

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:05.250
Thank you very much, Madam.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:08.080
This room has an exceptional view.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:11.000
However, it is now sirocco season,

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.050
so please refrain from opening the window.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:14.670
Sirocco?

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:17.640
It's a wind from the south which carries in sand from the desert.

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:21.930
It's quite troublesome to be exposed to.

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:25.270
The sand can be quite painful if it gets into your eyes.

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.560
Ah, thank you.

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:32.440
Well then, enjoy your stay.

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:55.090
Interpol has noticed a rise in terrorism over the years.

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:59.590
Because of this, we are pursuing new counter-terrorist measures.

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:04.600
We won't be the ones acting, however; rather, the terrorists themselves will.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:09.730
We will be playing the terrorists against each other.

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:13.570
In two words: Destructive Interference.

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:18.610
I'll take this one.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:22.490
Take a look at this:

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:24.790
This woman...

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:30.790
Known through Europe as the blood-stained sniper from Germany.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:32.420
Her name: Brigitta.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.880
She has been connected with terrorist activities in Europe last year.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:40.260
The counterbalance operation revolves around her.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:44.970
There is an agency between us and Brigitta, so our involvement will never be known.

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:48.270
She has already removed two targets.

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:53.980
Therefore we shall go ahead with operation Destructive Interference.

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.490
And who is the next target?

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:00.660
This man.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:33.230
I held my breath and kept waiting while my heart was scratched away

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:44.570
A minute, a second never felt so long

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:56.340
I look up at the sky and ask the wind, "Can I fly now?"

00:03:56.540 --> 00:04:02.630
The weak person I was is no more

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:08.220
I decided to just believe

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:15.350
With the dreams I once had in my hand now

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:19.190
I go towards you

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:26.910
Carrying those emotions I felt when I broke

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:31.040
I go towards you

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:35.080
Blown by the wind

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:40.550
Oh blown

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:48.430
Santa Ana

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:00.480
Splendid!

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:03.490
You're late.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:08.320
It can't be helped. It's the client's fault.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:11.700
Ah, your eyes are still puffy.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:12.790
I'm fine.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.250
Please take care of yourself.

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:19.130
For a sniper, eyes are everything.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.550
That's not important. Are the preparations complete?

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.260
Flawlessly.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:28.180
The hotel suite has been reserved, and the man is coming tonight.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:31.850
Still, what are you going to do when you meet him?

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:34.680
That's none of your business.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:41.440
Brigitta.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:43.940
Don't die.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.770
Hotel keys...

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:23.150
Mean nothing to you, do they?

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:27.740
You came first to check out the room.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.490
That caution is proof of your professionalism.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:33.200
Nice to meet you. I'm Brigitta.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:42.710
Have you heard of me? We're in the same business.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:46.710
You of course, are the legendary sniper...

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:48.340
Golgo 13.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:56.970
Still can't trust me?

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:10.110
No need to search me.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.120
This style puts you at ease, doesn't it?

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:24.420
But if I keep standing up, even I can't keep looking good.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:26.880
Since I'm a woman...

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:30.170
Search my womanly parts.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:31.880
In bed.

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:36.810
Or possibly...

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:40.270
Would you prefer to keep staring at me like this?

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:55.490
What is Brigitta trying to pull?

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.950
Why is she meeting the target?

00:07:58.790 --> 00:07:59.910
What's going on?

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:04.500
I believe she has confidence in her plan.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:09.050
Even Victorio does not know why she is contacting him.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:16.800
However, I heard that she is spending twice as much time in her preparations,

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:19.890
so I believe she has the utmost confidence in her plan.

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.560
I agree, but...

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:27.860
The condition of her contract was to leave everything up to her.

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.570
Trust is the only option.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.070
By the way...

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:37.160
Maybe it's too late to ask, but is Golgo really a terrorist?

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:39.240
What do you mean?

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:44.710
He is a sniper, he does kill people, and sometimes his behavior is similar to a terrorist...

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.330
However, he does not follow any ideologies.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:51.170
It is just that in his heart, he has no limit to his determination.

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:54.590
He is a peerless killer.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:59.930
Should we really add such a target to priority missions at this time?

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:07.770
In my opinion...

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:11.820
Golgo 13 is a reform-minded terrorist.

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:17.110
Perhaps his mind does not have room for other people's ideologies.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:22.240
But this is a paradoxical way of thinking,

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:25.750
the idea of not accepting ideas.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:30.460
A person who considers his job to be meaningless,

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:33.130
has a meaningless job.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.840
Don't you agree?

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:40.180
Even if his sniping is based on terrorizing,

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:45.810
it's his resolute stance to try to rebel against the world's established values.

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:34.320
Now, time for business.

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:43.370
The second stop from Los's Union Station.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.500
It's a town about 57km and 50 minutes from here.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:47.960
Santa Ana.

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.960
I want you to make the man who runs the meat packing business there disappear.

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:55.840
His name is Dick Carvada.

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:58.420
The meat packing is just a front.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:00.380
He's actually a mafia boss.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:04.850
If he were alone, I would be fine...

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:08.980
but he is guarded 24 hours a day by many men.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.350
I simply am not capable of doing this.

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:15.730
Please...

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:17.860
Accept the job.

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:19.820
Golgo 13.

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:26.370
*Santa Ana*

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:10.500
Wel-

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.250
W-welcome.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:17.800
Do you have a room?

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.260
Ah... Y-yes.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.090
This way please.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:32.520
Yes?

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.600
H-he just arrived!

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:39.110
It's just as you said, an Asian man with a penetrating gaze.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:41.940
Ah, thank you.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:45.240
If something happens, please call me again.

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:54.210
Ah, Mr. Carvada, it's me.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:13:01.090
Yes, as I thought. Golgo went to the nearby motel.

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:04.170
He's definitely after you, isn't he?

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:09.640
Oh, it's not important who I am.

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.430
Either way, I am not your enemy.

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.060
Do your best...

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:21.070
Golgo 13.

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:38.690
Yeah, Tiger!

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.820
He's a monster!

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:54.450
This is the end.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:07.090
Over there!

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:28.690
After him!

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:29.950
Get in, quickly!

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:36.990
Hello? Hello?!

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:43.000
This is terrible!  Gangsters are chasing the Asian man!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:47.630
It is too early to go and watch the match.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:21.620
Fool! There's only our factory this way!

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:38.260
Wh- What?

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.710
You'll never escape by just driving randomly!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:17.970
Stop!

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:23.390
What is it?

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:24.430
It's a trap!

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:27.980
Everybody get out and spread out, or he'll snipe us!

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:56.800
He's a real pussy, isn't he?

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:58.890
Not a chance.

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:01.100
He's going to start picking us off.

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:02.970
You a pussy too?

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:08.270
Don't underestimate him if you value your life.

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:11.230
This doesn't sound like you Alex.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:14.320
Look at me you punk-ass bitch!

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:13.570
Hey!

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:19.030
Damn you...

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:23.040
In here, we have no idea where he's shooting from.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.500
There's also the damn sand...

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:29.540
Let's hunt him down slowly! Everybody spread out and find him.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.350
Over there!

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:57.610
Shiit...

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:58.740
Come on!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:01.320
Over there!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:26.720
Damnit! After him!

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:23.070
You're here, right?

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:24.490
Golgo 13!

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:30.950
You must have realized by now that this is my trap.

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:39.590
I did not intend for the gangsters to kill you.

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:50.100
By now you should hardly be able to see from the sand in your eyes.

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:57.190
It must be painful, no wonder you hid in this warehouse.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:06.200
Now we should be able to fight on an even footing.

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:10.240
Show yourself, Golgo 13!

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:26.840
N-no way.....

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:30.220
No way!!

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:53.500
As expected...

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:55.750
Golgo 13...

00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:39.040
It doesn't matter anymore

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:44.590
Who craved freedom first

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:53.640
How we decided to part, and how we loved each other

00:22:53.640 --> 00:22:55.810
As nostalgic and simply just that

00:22:55.850 --> 00:23:04.070
Once you've lost it you'll feel lonely

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:07.740
You may have to overcome the pain

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:12.990
Many times with that cruel heart of yours

00:23:13.070 --> 00:23:21.290
But you just can't become as strong as you've imagined

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:25.880
It was just a dream

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:29.260
So let us return to tomorrow

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:34.260
In this calm night

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:36.430
There'll only be wanderers

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:41.600
But now you've awakened, so walk down that path of yours

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:47.610
And even though time is fleeting

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:54.120
People sometimes desire too much

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:04.500
America, summertime in Florida.

00:24:05.130 --> 00:24:08.510
Sentenced to life in prison, José escaped during a convoy.

00:24:08.510 --> 00:24:16.470
Fleeing down the highway with the latest model armoured car...

00:24:17.060 --> 00:24:19.640
Only Golgo, disguised as a cop, stands between him and the border.

00:24:19.980 --> 00:24:25.230
Florida Chase

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:21.810
Next time on Goldbond 13:

00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:23.520
Florida Chase

00:24:23.850 --> 00:24:27.690
Don't stand behind him if you value your life.
